        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This is a bit of a strange missing page.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Spec: <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-credential-management/#dom-credential-isconditionalmediationavailable\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-credential-management/#dom-credential-isconditionalmediationavailable</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sub classes override this, so <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredential/isConditionalMediationAvailable_static\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PublicKeyCredential/isConditionalMediationAvailable_static</a> is more meaningful here, but we should probably talk about the more abstract <code class=\"notranslate\">Credential.isConditionalMediationAvailable()</code> static method so that no one gets confused by it.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41022",
            "title": "Document Credential: isConditionalMediationAvailable() static method",
