        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates the <code class=\"notranslate\">pr-review-companion</code> workflow to report the review deployment status via <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/rest/commits/statuses?apiVersion=2022-11-28\">commit statuses</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This should make it easier:</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>to understand that the <code class=\"notranslate\">pr-review-companion</code> workflow is running (in the background),</li>\n<li>to notice failed <code class=\"notranslate\">pr-review-companion</code> runs.</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Follow up of:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3382652182\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41013\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/41013/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41013\">#41013</a></li>\n</ul>",
